er : sauvegarde nocturne copiée hors VM ; restauration vérifiée par un ticket." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#172033;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="125.1" y="1235.0" width="539.6" height="22.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="d189" value="5" style="ellipse;html=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;fillColor=#172033;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="52.0" y="1263.0" width="26.0" height="26.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="d190" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=25;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="86.0" y="1264.0" width="31.1" height="24.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="d191" value="P3" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="87.0" y="1265.0" width="29.1" height="22.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="d192" value="Orchestrer et observer : copie dans K3s, Prometheus, Grafana, charge k6." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#172033;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="125.1" y="1265.0" width="474.2" height="22.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="d193" value="Retour arrière : redéployer la version précédente, sans restaurer la base. K3s ne pilote pas les conteneurs de srv-app." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="52.0" y="1298.0" width="744.3" height="22.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="d194" value="" s